@startuml development_view

skinparam shadowing false

component "Frontend\nHTML / CSS / JavaScript" as Frontend
component "Flask API" as API
component "Backend\nPython Classes" as Backend

component "Testing\npytest / Hypothesis" as Tests
component "GitHub Actions" as CI
component "Docker" as Docker

Frontend -right-> API : HTTP / JSON
API -right-> Backend

Tests -up-> Backend : validates
Tests ..> API : tests
CI -right-> Tests : runs
Docker ..> API : environment

@enduml